    "RAG-ab61dd8f4d27da0e": [
      {
        "start": 0,
        "end": 342,
        "quote": "The initial form says No blackouts, but during further questioning the driver reports a blackout while queuing in the heat six weeks ago and describes a second collapse the following week; he recovered quickly, says someone suggested a faint, and has not been told by a treating clinician that either event was definitively vasovagal syncope.",
